title ALES40 — Lotus's tone control: a one-pole filter that shapes a clip's brightness, integer-exact
prompt Continue the ALES recursion loop Lindy-first crux-first; approve my own design rounds and make progress before checking in; send each finished increment to origin and xykj61 as its own signed round; stop at custody gates; baton prin recur
think Read REMEMBER (head stale at DREY6/HUNK), the 1024-round itinerary, and the six-season double-seat. git log showed the true living edge is the ALES ladder — Lotus creative suite (Season C) — at ALES39. ALES39's design read said the persistence arc is whole and its two named next-cruxes (signed carry via a Kumara key, wire carry) are explicitly deferred to Keaton's word. So within Lotus the next durable rung had to be a NEW capability, not a deferred seam.
think Surveyed lotus/: every gesture changes level (gain, fade), arrangement (splice, joins, mix), or map (markers, racks) — none changes FREQUENCY. Confirmed no eq/filter/biquad/tone module or witness exists. A tone control is the canonical missing floor of any creative suite — Lindy-first (the one knob turned on the ten-thousandth session), crux-first (a recursive IIR filter that stays exactly reproducible on integer PCM).
think The crux is exact direct current on integer PCM. A plain shift-based one-pole leaves a residual steady-state offset (the fractional step truncates to zero before reaching the target). Fixed it by carrying full-precision i64 state (estimate scaled by den) and a forced unit step: when the fractional step truncates to zero yet the gap remains, advance by one. This reaches a constant input EXACTLY in finite steps, and because |step| <= |gap| always, convergence is monotone — no overshoot, the low-pass character proven, not asserted by hope.
think High-pass is the exact complement: saturate(x - low_pass(x)). Where the difference fits, low_pass + high_pass = x sample-for-sample (exact reconstruction, witnessed per-sample); a constant input drives it to exactly zero (direct current removed — a bass cut); a transient past the i16 range saturates rather than wraps, reused from ALES2 timeline.saturate. num=den is the identity (pass-through); a smaller fraction smooths harder. BadCoeff refuses den=0, num<1, num>den (coefficient above one — unstable); BadRange refuses a span outside the clip, clip untouched.
obs GREEN on metal first build across six cases: silence stays silence; identity coefficient (num=den) passes the low-pass through byte-for-byte and high-passes to silence; a constant 1000 over 30 samples low-passes monotonically, never exceeds 1000, first sample rolled off below it, last equals 1000 EXACTLY (the crux); high-pass reconstructs (lp+hp=x per sample on a moderate mixed signal) and removes direct current (an 800 run settles to 0); a sample_max jump after a 60-sample sample_min run SATURATES to +32767 rather than wrapping; a zero/negative numerator, a zero denominator, and a coefficient above one each refuse BadCoeff, an out-of-range span refuses BadRange leaving the clip untouched.
obs Witness tools/ales_tone_witness.rish GREEN; tame_style_check GREEN (bans clean, tone.rye carries ample asserts so it is not on the zero-assert exempt list). Reused whole: timeline.Clip, timeline.saturate, timeline.splice. Purely local — bounded i16 PCM in one in-process buffer; no socket, no network, no keys, no funds, no real device, no real sample rate (the coefficient is a smoothing fraction over sample indices, not a cutoff in hertz — a real time base is a later rung); every custody gate untouched.
loom witness=ales_tone_witness result=green build=first cases=6 filter=one-pole-iir state_bits=64 dc=exact convergence=monotone reused=timeline.saturate
file lotus/tone.rye ALES40 module — low_pass and high_pass, a one-pole filter reaching direct current exactly on integer PCM, the high-pass the exact saturating complement
file tools/ales_tone_witness.rish the witness that builds and proves it GREEN on metal
file active-designing/20260814-160501_fill-ales40-lotus-tone-control.md the self-approved design read for the round
file lotus/README.md front door synced — status list (ALES40 tone control), the tone.rye rung entry, road-on paragraph
recommend keep-going ALES41 can sum a low-pass and a high-pass at chosen levels into a two-band bass/treble shelf, or carry the filter state across a re-berthed span so a filter spans without a fresh transient; the signed and wire session carries stay module seams for Keaton's word
